{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026GxsKwURHz21793104942.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中國證監會前黨委委員王會民涉嫌受賄4.36億元人民幣，一審被判死緩。</p><p></p><p>案件在成都中級法院公開宣判，67歲的王會民被指在新疆金融部門及中證監等部門任職期間，利用職務便利，為相關單位及個人，在企業經營、募集資金等方面提供幫助，非法收受財物折合人民幣4.36億元。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.OFFICIAL-2000_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026e44Fa2LYN71793104951.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>法院指，其受賄數額特別巨大，令國家同人民利益遭受特別重大損失，論罪當判處死刑，鑒於其受賄有未遂情節，且主動交代罪行事實，於是判處死緩，沒收個人全部財產，其受賄所得依法上繳國庫。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T13:02:02.987960+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":218,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T11:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T14:58:25.211995+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T12:58:28.307800+00:00","content_hash":"6f71f42b41606d930783a0ca74d1bed4f578a302cb137618021fbe96944976ef","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}